{"version":1,"content":"<p>移居香港的33歲日本前AV女優濱崎真緒，於萬聖節（10月31日）夜赴尖沙咀酒吧演出期間，懷疑遭到有心人士於飲品中「落藥」。</p><p>事發後她因全身抽搐僵硬被緊急送往伊利沙伯醫院，院方檢測出其體內對4種藥物（含Happy水等毒品）呈陽性反應，一度需轉入</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:45.538033+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:05:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:03.280388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:03.280388+00:00","content_hash":"dd283985867b4b926508cec71334f7b16bb08f1fabd888107a642d93884a0a64","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}